# AskUserQuestion needs you but isn't a permission prompt, so it's split off.
# event             matcher                   status
UserPromptSubmit    -                         working
PreToolUse          ^(?!AskUserQuestion$).*$  working
PreToolUse          ^AskUserQuestion$         waiting
PostToolUse         ^AskUserQuestion$         working
PostToolUseFailure  ^AskUserQuestion$         working
SubagentStart       -                         working
PreCompact          -                         working
PermissionRequest   -                         waiting
PermissionResult    -                         working
Stop                -                         done
Interrupt           -                         done
